# Optional: enable the NASA ADS source (astrophysics & space-science index).
#
# 1. Sign in (free) at https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/
# 2. Account → Settings → API Token → Generate a new key.
# 3. Copy this file to  .streamlit/secrets.toml  and paste your token below.
#
# (Or set an ADS_API_TOKEN environment variable instead — either works.)
# secrets.toml is git-ignored, so your token never gets committed.

